---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | TAKA Scientific"
  description="The terms and conditions that apply to your use of the TAKA Scientific website and to products and services purchased from us."
  hasHero={true}
  headerSolid={true}
>
  <Legal
    eyebrow="Terms of Use"
    title="Clear terms, fair dealings."
    intro="These Terms of Use govern your use of taka.ae and the products and services supplied by TAKA Scientific."
    updated="6 August 2026"
  >
    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">1. Agreement</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        By accessing taka.ae or placing an order with TAKA Scientific, you
        agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree with any
        part of these terms, please do not use the website or our services.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">2. Use of the website</h2>
      <ul class="legal-ul">
        <li class="legal-li">Use the website only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not disrupt, damage, or interfere with it.</li>
        <li class="legal-li">Do not attempt to gain unauthorised access to the website, its servers, or connected systems.</li>
        <li class="legal-li">Do not reproduce, distribute, or commercialise content from the website without our prior written consent.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">3. Products and information</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        We work to ensure product descriptions, specifications, and images are
        accurate, but they are provided for general information only and do not
        form part of any contract unless confirmed in writing. Specifications
        are subject to change by manufacturers without notice.
      </p>
      <p class="legal-p">
        Some products are sourced to order. Before purchase, please confirm
        availability, exact specifications, and compliance with your intended
        application.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">4. Quotes and orders</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        Quotations are valid for the period stated on the quote. Orders are
        accepted only when we confirm them in writing. We may decline or cancel
        an order where information is inaccurate, stock is unavailable, or
        payment is not received.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">5. Pricing and payment</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        Prices are stated in the currency of the quotation and are exclusive of
        value-added tax unless otherwise indicated. Payment terms are set out
        on the invoice. We may adjust prices where costs change between the
        quote and order confirmation, in which case we will confirm with you
        first.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">6. Delivery and installation</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        Delivery and installation timelines are estimates provided in good
        faith and may vary due to logistics, site readiness, or manufacturer
        availability. Risk in delivered goods passes to you on delivery. We
        will coordinate access and installation schedules with your team.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">7. Warranties</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        Products are covered by the manufacturer’s warranty applicable at the
        time of sale. Installation and after-sales services are carried out to
        a professional standard. Warranty terms, including coverage periods and
        exclusions, will be confirmed with your order.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">8. Returns and refunds</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        Returns and refunds are handled on a case-by-case basis in line with
        the applicable agreement and the manufacturer’s policy. Please contact
        us promptly if goods arrive damaged or do not match your order.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">9. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        The TAKA Scientific name, logo, and all website content, including
        text, images, and design, are owned by or licensed to TAKA Scientific
        and may not be used without our written permission.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">10. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, TAKA Scientific is not liable
        for indirect or consequential losses arising from use of the website or
        the supply of products and services. Nothing in these terms limits
        liability that cannot be excluded by law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">11. Governing law</h2>
      <p class="legal-p">
        These Terms of Use are governed by the laws of the United Arab Emirates.
        Any disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of
        Abu Dhabi.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2 class="legal-h2">12. Contact us</h2>
      <div class="legal-contact">
        <p class="legal-p"><strong>TAKA Scientific</strong></p>
        <p class="legal-p">Email: <a class="legal-a" href="mailto:info@taka.ae">info@taka.ae</a></p>
        <p class="legal-p">Phone: <a class="legal-a" href="tel:+97125554047">+971 2 555 4047</a></p>
        <p class="legal-p">Abu Dhabi, United Arab Emirates</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </Legal>
</Layout>
